Service definitions in this directory (*.toml or *.json) are registered when the
agent starts. Example web.toml:

    name = "web"
    port = 8080
    tags = ["v2"]

    [[checks]]
    type = "http"
    url = "http://127.0.0.1:8080/health"
    interval = "10s"

See https://github.com/wankdanker/lictor/blob/main/docs/configuration.md
